        spec: "On more than one occasion followed and watched {V} without legal purpose while a court order was in effect, on {DATE}.",
        ages: 21...55,
        victim: true,
        summary: "After {DL}'s case in this court in {PRIORDATE} for {PRIOR}, {D} was seen three times outside {V}'s workplace after a no-contact order was entered. Security video showed {DL}'s car parked across the street.",
        state: [E(.video, 3, "Security Camera", "{D}'s car parked across from the office three mornings."), E(.document, 2, "No-Contact Order", "Entered after the earlier case; stay 100 feet away.")],
        defense: [E(.statement, 1, "Coffee Shop", "{DL} says the coffee shop across the street is on {D.his} route.")],
        role: "Sheriff's detective",
        exam: [.direct("What were you asked to investigate?", "\"{V} reported that a car connected to {DL} had been seen near {V.his} workplace after a no-contact order was entered.\""), .direct("What did the security video show?", "\"It showed {DL}'s car parked across the street from the office on three different mornings, each time for several minutes.\""), .direct("What did the court order say?", "\"The no-contact order said {DL} had to stay at least a hundred feet away from {V} and from where {V.he} worked.\""), .direct("How far was the car from {V}'s building?", "\"Across a two-lane street from the front entrance, which is well within a hundred feet by any measurement I took.\""), .direct("What did {V} tell you about how this affected {V.him}?", "\"{V} said {V.he} now parks in a different lot, walks in with a coworker, and watches the street before going out.\""), .direct("What did {DL} say about being there?", "\"{D.He} said a coffee shop across the street is on {D.his} morning route and denied following {V} or watching {V.him}.\""), .cross("There's a coffee shop across the street, correct?", "\"Yes, there is, and it was open on those mornings. I confirmed that when I went to look.\""), .cross("{DL} never approached {V}?", "\"No. Nothing in the video or the reports shows {D.him} getting out of the car or speaking to anyone.\""), .cross("The car was parked on a public street?", "\"Yes, a public street with metered parking, and I have no complaint that the car blocked anyone.\""), .cross("You can't say {DL} was looking at the office?", "\"The video doesn't show {D.his} eyes. I can only say where the car was and when.\""), .cross("Three mornings is not every day, is it?", "\"No, it was three mornings over about two weeks, not every day.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} watched {V} despite an order.", "A man buying coffee on his route."),
        allocution: "\"I'll find another route. My morning coffee stop was at that shop, and I never meant to look at {V}'s workplace. I know there's an order, and I'm sorry my car was parked where it was. I won't go near that block again.\"",
