        mood: .sympathetic,
        impact: "I park in a different lot now and walk in with a coworker. Three times I noticed the same car across from my office after I was told there'd be no contact. I look through the glass at the front door before I go outside. It's changed how I live my days.",
        genders: ["D": .male])

